<title>FINLAND: Pohjola 1996 op profit rises 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Pohjola 1996 op profit rises 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit				   526 vs 461</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   7.32 vs 5.03</p>
<p> Proposed dividend				 2.00 vs 1.50</p>
<p> Net investment income			    962 vs 672</p>
<p> Net asset value per share (markka)	144.27 vs 107.72</p>
<p> Claims ratio (percent)			 95.03 vs 88.09</p>
<p> Expense ratio (percent)			21.99 vs 20.21</p>
